    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Consider the following dataset before and after a transformation:[HTML]<div style='background: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 10px 0;'><table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;'><thead><tr style='background: #e2e8f0;'><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>Set</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>Values</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>Range</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>Original</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>{4, 6, 9, 11, 15}</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>11</td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>New</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>Each datum × 3 + 5</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>?</td></tr></tbody></table></div>[/HTML]Find the range of the new dataset.",
    "question_zh": "考慮以下數據組在其變換前後的情況：[HTML]<div style='background: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 10px 0;'><table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;'><thead><tr style='background: #e2e8f0;'><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>數據組</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>數值</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>全距</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>原始</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>{4, 6, 9, 11, 15}</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>11</td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>新數據</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>每個數據 × 3 + 5</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>?</td></tr></tbody></table></div>[/HTML]求新數據組的全距。",
    "options": [
      "A. 11",
      "B. 33",
      "C. 38",
      "D. 48"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Range is a measure of dispersion.",
      "Addition ($+5$) does not affect the range.",
      "Multiplication by 3 scales the range by 3.",
      "New Range $= 11 \\times 3 = 33$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "全距是離散程度的量度。",
      "加法 ($+5$) 不會影響全距。",
      "乘以 3 會使全距按比例縮放 3 倍。",
      "新全距 $= 11 \\times 3 = 33$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["statistics", "data-transformation"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
