    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "How many points of intersection are there between the straight line $y = 2x - 5$ and the circle $x^2 + y^2 = 4$?",
    "question_zh": "直線 $y = 2x - 5$ 與圓 $x^2 + y^2 = 4$ 有多少個交點？",
    "options": [
      "A. 0",
      "B. 1",
      "C. 2",
      "D. 3"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Substitute $y = 2x - 5$ into the circle equation:",
      "$x^2 + (2x - 5)^2 = 4$.",
      "$x^2 + 4x^2 - 20x + 25 = 4$.",
      "$5x^2 - 20x + 21 = 0$.",
      "Discriminant $\\Delta = (-20)^2 - 4(5)(21) = 400 - 420 = -20$.",
      "Since $\\Delta < 0$, there are no real roots, so there are 0 points of intersection."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "將 $y = 2x - 5$ 代入圓方程：",
      "$x^2 + (2x - 5)^2 = 4 \\Rightarrow 5x^2 - 20x + 21 = 0$。",
      "判別式 $\\Delta = (-20)^2 - 4(5)(21) = -20$。",
      "由於 $\\Delta < 0$，沒有實根，故交點數目為 0。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["intersection", "discriminant"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_287",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_coord"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Points $A(2, 2)$, $B(8, 2)$ and $C(5, 7)$ are vertices of $\\triangle ABC$.\n(a) Find the length of the base $AB$. (3 marks)\n(b) Find the height of the triangle with respect to the base $AB$. (3 marks)\n(c) Hence, calculate the area of $\\triangle ABC$. (5 marks)",
    "question_zh": "點 $A(2, 2)$、$B(8, 2)$ 及 $C(5, 7)$ 為 $\\triangle ABC$ 的頂點。\n(a) 求底 $AB$ 的長度。(3分)\n(b) 求相對於底 $AB$ 的三角形高。(3分)\n(c) 因此，計算 $\\triangle ABC$ 的面積。(5分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Since $A$ and $B$ have the same $y$-coordinate (2), the length $AB = 8 - 2 = 6$ units.",
      "(b) The height is the difference in $y$-coordinates between $C(5, 7)$ and the line $y = 2$. Height $= 7 - 2 = 5$ units.",
      "(c) Area $= \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\text{base} \\times \\text{height} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 \\times 5 = 15$ sq. units."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 由於 $A$ 及 $B$ 的 $y$-坐標相同 (2)，底 $AB$ 的長度為 $8 - 2 = 6$ 單位。",
      "(b) 高為 $C(5, 7)$ 的 $y$-坐標與直線 $y = 2$ 的差。高 $= 7 - 2 = 5$ 單位。",
      "(c) 面積 $= \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 \\times 5 = 15$ 平方單位。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": {
      "canvas": { "width": 400, "height": 300, "viewBox": "0 0 400 300" },
