    },
    "tags": ["coordinate-geometry", "area-of-triangle"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_288",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_apgp"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The first term of a geometric sequence is 12 and the third term is 3.\n(a) Find the possible values of the common ratio $r$. (4 marks)\n(b) If the common ratio is positive, find the sum to infinity of the sequence. (7 marks)",
    "question_zh": "一等比數列的首項為 12，第三項為 3。\n(a) 求公比 $r$ 的所有可能值。(4分)\n(b) 若公比為正數，求該數列的無限項之和。(7分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $a = 12, T_3 = ar^2 = 3$.",
      " $12r^2 = 3 \\implies r^2 = 1/4 \\implies r = 0.5$ or $r = -0.5$.",
      "(b) For $r = 0.5$: $S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r} = \\frac{12}{1 - 0.5} = \\frac{12}{0.5} = 24$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $a = 12, ar^2 = 3 \\implies r^2 = 1/4$。故 $r = 0.5$ 或 $r = -0.5$。",
      "(b) 當 $r = 0.5$：$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r} = \\frac{12}{1 - 0.5} = 24$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["geometric-sequence", "sum-to-infinity"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_289",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_mensuration"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A right pyramid has a square base of side length 10 cm. The height of the pyramid is 12 cm.\n(a) Find the slant height of each triangular face. (4 marks)\n(b) Calculate the total surface area of the pyramid. (8 marks)",
    "question_zh": "一個直四稜錐的底面為邊長 10 cm 的正方形。稜錐的高為 12 cm。\n(a) 求每個側三角面的斜高。(4分)\n(b) 計算該稜錐的總表面面積。(8分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Let $h=12$ and half-side $s/2 = 5$.",
      " Slant height $l = \\sqrt{h^2 + (s/2)^2} = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = \\sqrt{169} = 13$ cm.",
      "(b) Base area $= 10 \\times 10 = 100$ cm$^2$.",
      " Area of 4 side triangles $= 4 \\times (\\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 13) = 260$ cm$^2$.",
      " Total surface area $= 100 + 260 = 360$ cm$^2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 設高 $h=12$，底邊一半為 5。斜高 $l = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = 13$ cm。",
      "(b) 底面積 $= 100$ cm$^2$。4 個側面的總面積 $= 4 \\times (\\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 13) = 260$ cm$^2$。",
      "總表面面積 $= 100 + 260 = 360$ cm$^2$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["mensuration", "pyramid"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_290",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 13,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Seven students (A, B, C, D, E, F, G) are to be arranged in a row.\n(a) Find the total number of ways they can be arranged if there are no restrictions. (3 marks)\n(b) Find the number of ways if A and B must not be next to each other. (5 marks)\n(c) Find the number of ways if no two of A, B and C are next to each other. (5 marks)",
    "question_zh": "七名學生 (A, B, C, D, E, F, G) 排成一列。\n(a) 若無限制，求排列的方法數目。(3分)\n(b) 若 A 及 B 必須不相鄰，求排列的方法數目。(5分)\n(c) 若 A、B 及 C 之中任何兩者均不相鄰，求排列的方法數目。(5分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Total $= 7! = 5040$.",
      "(b) Total - (A, B together). Case (A, B together): $6! \\times 2! = 1440$.",
      " Ways $= 5040 - 1440 = 3600$.",
      "(c) Use the 'gap' method. First arrange D, E, F, G: $4!$ ways.",
      " 5 gaps are formed: _X_X_X_X_ . Place A, B, C in any 3 gaps: $P^5_3$ ways.",
      " Total ways $= 4! \\times (5 \\times 4 \\times 3) = 24 \\times 60 = 1440$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 總排列數 $= 7! = 5040$。",
      "(b) 總數 - (A, B 相鄰)。相鄰情況：$6! \\times 2! = 1440$。不相鄰：$5040 - 1440 = 3600$。",
      "(c) 「插空法」。先排 D, E, F, G：$4!$ 種。產生 5 個間隙元。A, B, C 入 3 隙：$P^5_3 = 60$ 種。總數 $= 24 \\times 60 = 1440$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["permutations", "non-adjacent"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
